  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening UNHCR-FAO Partnership to enhance Economic Inclusion of Refugees in Agriculture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this project is to coordinate FAO and UNHCR efforts to develop, promote and strengthen joint actions for a coordinated, sustainable and technically sound agricultural livelihood support to refugees, asylum seekers, returnees, host communities and where applicable, IDPs, in camp and non-camp settings, including the coordination of the implementation of the FAO-UNHCR joint workplan.</narrative>
  </description>
